MODULE StoreTaskChatLib;

// Chat for the phone (#37366): the phone-facing half of the platform chat — a model on
// top of utils/Chat.lsf that the platform does not change by a single line, plus the
// JSON handles the phone reads and writes through. This package is a HOST OPTION, like
// ExternalApp, and deliberately not a part of StoreTaskLib:
//   * the platform Chat module brings the host a «Чат» menu item, the system chat and
//     server-start work — not every host wants that;
//   * in mite_public the name Chat already means Messenger.Chat (Management.lsf,
//     OrgManagement.lsf), and a host module seeing both would hit an ambiguous name.
// A host that wants chat requires this module — StoreTaskStandalone does, and ERP hosts
// get it through StoreTaskErp by a separate erp-logics change («мостики на erp живут в
// erp-logics»).
// The push/notification side is NOT here: it is a seam module (NotificationChat) that
// requires both this package and StoreTaskNotifyLib, and a host opts into it separately.
REQUIRE StoreTaskCoreLib,
        // платформенный чат: классы Chat/Message, участники, статусы, pushNotification
        Chat,
        // надстройка над моделью платформы (clientId, muted, phoneChat, имена, статусы,
        // настройка chatEnabled) и ручки телефона
        StoreTaskChat, ChatApi;

NAMESPACE StoreTask;
